Don't try Modula. It's a working language, but not very useful for
beginners. The concept behind it is quite different from most other
computer languages.

Pascal is much better for beginners.

If you're not a beginner, and have tried Pascal earlier, or even some
dialect of Basic, you might have a look at C. Note: don't touch C++, it's
more difficult than C, and although it has its benefits, you won't need it
to read the NetHack code anyway.

